    'Post-match':(o)=>[`What decided the match against ${o}?`,`Were your tactics effective today?`,`Which players impressed you most?`,`Will you make changes for the next fixture?`,`What is your message to supporters?`],
    'Tournament start':()=>[`What is your target for this tournament?`,`Which opponent concerns you most?`,`How ready is your squad?`,`Will young players get opportunities?`,`What would success look like?`],
